  "description": "The Katahdin: Rugged. Adaptable. Functional.\nThe Katahdin is not a bike that puts the rider in an ultra-aggressive or stretched-out position. It features a frame with a relatively tall stack and a long wheelbase, designed to provide a comfortable riding position and enhanced stability for long hours in the saddle.\nThe Katahdin is not a fragile or featherweight gravel bike. Tested to mountain bike standards, it offers above-average durability and instant pedaling responsiveness thanks to its high stiffness.\nThe Katahdin doesn’t rely on unique or complex technologies. Every component is standard, easy to maintain, and simple to replace — a major advantage when heading out into remote areas with peace of mind.\nWhether you're embarking on long self-supported adventures, tackling ultra-distance events, or going on bikepacking trips, the Katahdin is built to last and perform.\nIf you're looking for better control on rough surfaces without sacrificing the rolling efficiency of a 45/50mm tire, add Cane Creek suspension. For more comfort and less fatigue, add Redshift options.",
